      "detail": "[exceptionflow_exit_coverage] Exception claim 3 lets the operator acknowledge and silence the alarm, but does not define what happens next: no return to main flow, termination/handoff, or terminal state. (atomic grounding: candidate remains incomplete (Explicit evidence that changing the alarm icon returns the display from the alarm exception to normal status, i.e., that the display exits the alarm exception state.))",
      "evidence_refs": []
