        "Alternative claim 1 (configuring refresh interval beyond 2 seconds) is recorded against main-flow step 2, but step 2 covers displaying sensor status icons. The refresh interval relates to main-flow step 4 (status updates every 2 seconds), so the divergence point is logically unrelated.",
